27974      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
27975      data a;
27976      input y x1 $ x2 $;
27977      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

27990      ;
27991      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
27992      proc transreg ss2;
27993      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
27994      output coefficients replace;
27995      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA38 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1725.

